This package bundles Eigen 3.4.0 in inst/include/Eigen. Eigen is primarily
Mozilla Public License 2.0. Some files also carry:

- BSD-3-Clause, Intel Corporation (2011), for the MKL/LAPACKE bindings.
- BSD-3-Clause, Willow Garage, Inc. and Open Source Robotics Foundation, for
  AlignedBox::transform in src/Geometry/AlignedBox.h.
- Apache License 2.0, TensorFlow Authors (2017), for src/Core/arch/Default/BFloat16.h.
- An Intel Corporation 2001 permissive notice, retained in
  src/LU/arch/InverseSize4.h.
- IncompleteLUT.h is MPL-2.0. Its header records that the SPARSKIT ILUT
  implementation it is derived from was LGPL, and that the author permitted
  relicensing that implementation to MPL2. COPYING.LGPL is retained unchanged
  because the upstream COPYING.README names it.

The license texts shipped with this copy of Eigen are:

- inst/include/Eigen/COPYING.README
- inst/include/Eigen/COPYING.MPL2
- inst/include/Eigen/COPYING.BSD
- inst/include/Eigen/COPYING.APACHE
- inst/include/Eigen/COPYING.LGPL

Four headers in that tree have no per-file license header. They are part of
the Eigen 3.4.0 distribution and are covered by those COPYING files:

- src/Core/arch/HIP/hcc/math_constants.h
- src/misc/blas.h
- src/misc/lapack.h
- src/misc/lapacke_mangling.h

